{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ちゃん誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4歳ですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなったねえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもどんどん\n成長していくんだぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと一緒にいてもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nもう１つ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日誕生した物をご存知ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BRODY』本日創刊でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記念すべきvol.1に\n中田載せていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんと中田で\n乃木坂のあれこれを語ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの取材の日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材が始まる前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「中田さんに誕生日ケーキです！良かったら食べてください！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ありがとうございます～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」\n「大きい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いえいえ～中は小さいですよ～」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材が終わって控え室に戻ってすぐに\n開けてみると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"繊細で可愛くて綺麗なケーキが5つも！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん、5つ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってしまったーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんと中田と取材してくださった方々と\n和気藹々、ケーキでも食べながら\nお喋りしましょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"的なやつではないですか！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「花奈さんどれがいいですかー？」\n「誕生日なんでやっぱりここは中田さんから選んでください」\n「え～中田優柔不断なんだよな～ どれも美味しそ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピスタチオも好きだけど～ はっ！これマカロンついてる～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"的なやつではないですか！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が想像していたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3号くらいで\nみんなで分けて食べてください、的なやつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その場で開けて見てみようかとは思ったけど\n取材始まるし\n食べながらは失礼かな、と思ったのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、言い訳ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「中は小さいですよ～」発言"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです\n5つも買ってきてくださったわけですからね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲み物をたくさん用意してくださってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもカフェラテとかミルクティーとか\nケーキに合いそうなもの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今日はもうお茶でも飲みながら楽屋みたいな感覚で」\nとも おっしゃってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはどう考えても\nケーキを食べながらですね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故、気づかなかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の行動を\n思い出してみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキを受け取り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の前に引き寄せて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ココに置いてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の目の前に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰に取られるわけでもないのに\nこんなに近くに持ってきてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイーツ大好き過ぎて\n潜在的に食い意地がはってしまったのか\n完全に独り占めしてしまっていたのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対にこれは中田がその場で開けるやつでした..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に気の利かない自分に絶望しました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局\nその後にツアーのリハがあったので\nメンバーで分けさせていただきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"謝りたくてしょうがなかったけど\n中々会う機会が無くて\nまだ謝れてないんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気が利かなくてすみませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\nめちゃめちゃ美味しかったです！\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう言いたいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんないろんな思いがつまった『BRODY』\nまいやん表紙が目印です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーたくさん載ってるので\nチェックしてみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/08/21/6601069/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}